A database table named Loan_Records is given below. What is the output of the following SQL query?

SELECT COUNT(*)
FROM (
  SELECT Borrower, Bank_Manager
  FROM Loan_Records
) AS S
NATURAL JOIN (
  SELECT Bank_Manager, Loan_Amount
  FROM Loan_Records
) AS T;

